import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import SectionLabel from '../components/SectionLabel.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="Underwater Statues makes mounting hardware for camera rigs.">
  <SectionLabel text="About" />
  <div class="rule"></div>
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Hardware for the rig, made by someone who uses it.</h1>
    <p>Underwater Statues is a small hardware company run by a working photographer. Every part here started as something missing from a set: a thumbscrew that could be turned with cold hands, an adapter that let a receiver sit where it should, a bracket that held a laptop without a tripod's worth of clamps.</p>
    <p>Parts are designed in CAD, prototyped on the printer, used on real jobs, then produced in small runs. The journal is where the thinking happens — each product has an entry about why it exists and what changed along the way.</p>
    <p>Everything ships from Indiana. Questions go to the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
